     H*Factor 1 on MOVE/MOVEL is the format of whichever operand is
     H*the character or numeric one. With no date, time or timestamp
     H*operand at all there is nothing for it to describe.
     HDFTACTGRP(*NO)
     Da                S             10A
     Db                S             10A
     C     *ISO          MOVE      a             b
     C                   RETURN
